<title>INDIA: STOCKS WHICH MOVED INDIA'S BSE INDEX - AUGUST 8.</title>
<headline>STOCKS WHICH MOVED INDIA'S BSE INDEX - AUGUST 8.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is an analysis of the 30-share Bombay  Stock Exchange (BSE) index movement at the mid-session of friday.</p>
<p>The table shows the stocks which moved the index most during the day and their percentage contribution to the net change. The index at 12:30pm was 4422.22, 24.84 points or 0.56 percent lower than thursday's close.</p>
